      "GmdIndex" : 10,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "It's that time of year again!\r\nWe're here, too!\r\nCome on, come on, \r\nlet's decide on matching outfits!",
        "Jp" : "今年もこの季節がやってきましたよ！\r\n私たちもやってきましたよ！\r\nさぁさぁ、お揃いの服で決めましょう！"
